    "chunk_size_bytes": 1525,
    "chunk_text": "PARLIAMENT OF THE DEMOCRATICSOCIALIST REPUBLIC OFSRI LANKA\n\nINSTITUTE OF APPLIED STATISTICS,SRI LANKA(INCORPORATION)ACT, No. 38 OF 2011\n\nPrinted on the Order of Government\n\n[Certified on 20th September, 2011]\n\nPRINTED AT THE DEPARTMENT OF GOVERNMENT PRINTING, SRI LANKA\n\nTO BE PURCHASED AT THE GOVERNMENT PUBLICATIONS BUREAU, COLOMBO 5\n\nPrice : Rs. 6.00Postage : Rs. 10.00\n\nPublished as a Supplement to Part II of the Gazette of the DemocraticSocialist Republic of Sri Lanka of September 23, 2011\n\n1Institute of Applied Statistics, Sri Lanka(Incorporation) Act, No. 38 of 2011\n\nShort title\n\n2\u2014PL 005052 \u20143,090 (07/2010)\n\n[Certified on 20th September, 2011]\n\nL.D.\u2014O.(Inc.) 20/2010.\n\nAN ACT TO INCORPORATE THE INSTITUTE OF APPLIED STATISTICS,SRI LANKA\n\nWHEREAS an Association called and known as the \u201cAppliedStatistics Association of Sri Lanka\u201d has heretofore beenformed in Sri Lanka for the purpose of effectually carryingout it\u2019s objects and transacting all matters connected withthe said Association according to the rules agreed to by itsmembers:\n\nAND WHEREAS the said Association has heretoforesuccessfully carried out and transacted the several objectsand matters for which it was formed and has applied to beincorporated and it will be for the public advantage to grantthe said application:\n\nBE it therefore enacted by the Parliament of the DemocraticSocialist Republic of Sri Lanka as follows:\u2014\n\n1.This Act may be cited as the Institute of AppliedStatistics, Sri Lanka (Incorporation) Act, No. 38 of 2011."
  },
  {
    "doc_type": "lk_acts",
    "doc_id": "2011-09-20-2011-09-20-38-2011-en",
    "num": "2011-09-20-38-2011-en",
    "date_str": "2011-09-20",
    "description": "Institute of Applied Statistics, Sri Lanka (Incorporation)",
    "url_metadata": "https://documents.gov.lk/view/acts/acts_2011.html",
    "lang": "en",
    "url_pdf": "https://documents.gov.lk/view/acts/2011/9/38-2011_E.pdf",
