    "chunk_text": "PARLIAMENT OF THE DEMOCRATICSOCIALIST REPUBLIC OFSRI LANKA\n\nANURADHAPURA SRI PUSHPADANADEVELOPMENT FOUNDATION(INCORPORATION) ACT, No. 34 OF 2011\n\nPrinted on the Order of Government\n\n[Certified on 22nd August, 2011]\n\nPRINTED AT THE DEPARTMENT OF GOVERNMENT PRINTING, SRI LANKA\n\nTO BE PURCHASED AT THE GOVERNMENT PUBLICATIONS BUREAU, COLOMBO 5\n\nPrice : Rs. 6.00Postage : Rs. 10.00\n\nPublished as a Supplement to Part II of the Gazette of the DemocraticSocialist Republic of Sri Lanka of August 26, 2011\n\n1Anuradhapura Sri Pushpadana DevelopmentFoundation (Incorporation) Act, No. 34 of 2011\n\nShort title.\n\nPreamble.\n\n2\u2014PL 005079 \u20143,190 (07/2010)\n\n[Certified on 22nd August, 2011]\n\nAN ACT TO INCORPORATE THE ANURADHAPURA SRI PUSHPADANADEVELOPMENT FOUNDATION\n\nWHEREAS a Foundation called and known as\u201cAnuradhapura Sri Pushpadana Development Foundation\u201dhas heretofore been formed in Anuradhapura in Sri Lankafor the purpose of effectually carrying out and transactingall objects and matters connected with the said Foundationaccording to the rules agreed to by its members:\n\nAND WHEREAS the said Foundation has heretoforesuccessfully carried out and transacted the several objectsand matters for which it was formed and has applied to beincorporated and it will be expedient to grant such application:\n\nBE it therefore enacted by the Parliament of the DemocraticSocialist Republic of Sri Lanka as follows:\u2014\n\n1.This Act may be cited as the AnuradhapuraSri Pushpadana Development Foundation (Incorporation)Act, No. 34 of 2011."
  },
  {
    "doc_type": "lk_acts",
    "doc_id": "2011-08-22-2011-08-22-34-2011-en",
    "num": "2011-08-22-34-2011-en",
