    "chunk_text": "5.(1) The affairs of the Corporation shall, subject tothe other provisions of this Act, be administered by aCommittee consisting of a Chief Chairman, seven ViceChairmen, a Chief Secretary, Vice Secretary, a Treasurerand Auditor and Nineteen other Committee Members asmay be provided for in the rules made under section 8 andelected in accordance therewith.\n\n(2) The first Committee of the Corporation shall consistof the members of the Committee of the Foundation holding\n\nManagement ofthe affairs of theCorporation.\n\noffice on the day immediately preceding the date ofcommencement of this Act and who shall hold office until anew committee is elected under the rules of the Corporation.\n\n6.(1) The Board shall cause to be maintained a registerin which every person who on the date of commencement ofthis Act, is a member of the Corporation, and every personthereafter duly admitted as member of the Corporation shallhave inscribed in such register his name.\n\n(2) The register shall contain the following particulars:\u2014\n\n(a)name, address and occupation of the each Memberof the Corporation;\n\n(b)the date on which the name of the member wasinscribed in the register; and\n\n(c)the date on which any person ceased to be member.\n\n7.Cancellation of membership may cause due to one ofthe following reasons:\u2014\n\n(a)at the death of the member;\n\n(b)resignation;\n\n(c)mental incapacity; and\n\n(d)violation of any rules.\n\n8.(1) It shall be lawful for the Corporation, from timeto time, at any General Meeting and by a majority ofnot less than two-thirds of the members present and voting,to make rules, not inconsistent with the provisions ofthis Act or any other written law, for all or any of thefollowing matters:\u2014\n\n(a)the classification of membership, the admission,withdrawal or expulsion of members;\n\nRegister ofmembers.\n\nCancellation ofmembership.\n\nRules of theCorporation.\n\n5Anuradhapura Sri Pushpadana DevelopmentFoundation (Incorporation) Act, No. 34 of 2011"
