    "chunk_size_bytes": 1740,
    "chunk_text": "PARLIAMENT OF THE DEMOCRATICSOCIALIST REPUBLIC OFSRI LANKA\n\nRED LOTUS ORGANIZATION FORHUMANITARIAN SERVICES(INCORPORATION) ACT, No. 8 OF 2011\n\nPrinted on the Order of Government\n\n[Certified on 22nd March, 2011]\n\nPRINTED AT THE DEPARTMENT OF GOVERNMENT PRINTING, SRI LANKA\n\nTO BE PURCHASED AT THE GOVERNMENT PUBLICATIONS BUREAU, COLOMBO 5\n\nPrice : Rs. 6.00Postage : Rs. 10.00\n\nPublished as a Supplement to Part II of the Gazette of the DemocraticSocialist Republic of Sri Lanka of March 25, 2011\n\n1Red Lotus Organization for HumanitarianServices (Incorporation) Act, No. 8 of 2011\n\n2\u2014PL 004984\u20133,070 (07/2010)\n\n[Certified on 22nd March, 2011]\n\nL.D. O. Inc. 4/2010\n\nAN ACT TO INCORPORATE RED LOTUS ORGANIZATION FORHUMANITARIAN SERVICES\n\nWHEREAS an Organization called and known as the\u201cRed Lotus Organization for Humanitarian Services\u201dworking on Buddhist principles has heretofore beenestablished for the purpose of preventing and alleviatingsuffering of all beings at times of disaster of any nature bybringing about greater preparedness at national andinternational levels through effective coordination,collaboration and networking and by acting as a resourcebank for humanitarian services based on loving kindness,compassion, appreciative joy and equanimity;\n\nAND WHEREAS the said Organization has heretoforesuccessfully carried out and transacted the several objectsand matters for which it was established and has applied tobe incorporated and it will be for the public advantage togrant such application.\n\nBE IT THEREFORE enacted by the Parliament of theDemocratic Socialist Republic of Sri Lanka as follows :\u2014\n\n1.This Act may be cited as the Red Lotus Organizationfor Humanitarian Services (Incorporation) Act, No. 8 of 2011."
  },
  {
    "doc_type": "lk_acts",
    "doc_id": "2011-03-22-2011-03-22-08-2011-en",
    "num": "2011-03-22-08-2011-en",
    "date_str": "2011-03-22",
    "description": "Red Lotus Organization for Humanitarian Services (Incorporation)",
    "url_metadata": "https://documents.gov.lk/view/acts/acts_2011.html",
    "lang": "en",
    "url_pdf": "https://documents.gov.lk/view/acts/2011/3/08-2011_E.pdf",
