    "chunk_text": "PRINTED AT THE DEPARTMENT OF GOVERNMENT PRINTING, SRI LANKA\n\nTO BE PURCHASED AT THE GOVERNMENT PUBLICATIONS BUREAU, COLOMBO 5\n\nPrice : Rs. 4.00 Postage : Rs. 5.00\n\nPARLIAMENT OF THE DEMOCRATICSOCIALIST REPUBLIC OFSRI LANKA\n\nPublished as a Supplement to Part II of the Gazette of the DemocraticSocialist Republic of Sri Lanka of February 12, 2010\n\n\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\n\n\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\n\n[Certified on 09th February, 2010]\n\nPrinted on the Order of Government\n\n\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\n\nPULATHISI DARUWO FOUNDATIONTRUST (INCORPORATION)ACT, NO. 6 OF 2010\n\nPulathisi Daruwo Foundation Trust(Incorporation) Act, No. 6 of 20101\n\nShort title.\n\n[Certified on 09th February, 2010]\n\nL. D.\u2014O. (Inc.) 5/2008\n\nAN ACT TO iNCORPORATE THE PULATHISI DARUWO FOUNDATION TRUST\n\nWHEREAS a Foundation called and known as the \u201cPulathisiDaruwo Foundation Trust\u201d has been established inPolonnaruwa for the purpose of effectually carrying out andtransacting all objects and matters connected with the saidFoundation according to the rules agreed to by its members :\n\nAND WHEREAS the said Fundation has heretoforesuccessfully carried out and transacted several objects andmatters for which it was established and has applied to beincorporated, and it will be for the public advantage to grantthe application :\n\nBE it therefore enacted by the Parliament of the DemocraticSocialist Republic of Sri Lanka as follows :\u2014\n\n1. This Act may be cited as the Pulathisi DaruwoFoundation Trust (Incorporation) Act, No. 6 of 2010."
  },
