Act, No. 66 of 20092\n\n3.Section 5 of the principal enactment is herebyamended in subsection (2) by the substitution for the words\u201cBoard shall be three\u201d of the words \u201cBoard shall be five\u201d.\n\n4.Section 6 of the principal enactment is herebyamended as follows:\u2014"
